The objective part 9 is some text that varies. The objective part 9 is " Following that, make an attempt to go east. And then, take a trip south. If you can finish that, make an attempt to go to the south. Then, make an effort to venture south. And then, attempt to go wes".
The objective part 10 is some text that varies. The objective part 10 is "t. Then, go north. With that done, move east. With that done, move south. After that, go south. And then, move west. And then, travel south. Then, move east. Once you do that, take a trip south. And t".
